# Wireframe: Comment Card — Delete Flow (Issue Detail Page)

## Purpose & Flow Context

Allows the comment author to delete their own comment with a confirmation step. Serves the "Delete Comment" user flow. Entry: issue detail page with comments loaded. Exit: comment removed from list + toast confirmation.

**Doc version:** 0.2.0 (PATCH — add loading/empty state sketches; fix DS component reference)

### Changelog

| Version | Change |
|---------|--------|
| 0.2.0 | Add wireframe sketches for loading skeleton and empty state; align delete button DS reference with CommentCard entity naming |
| 0.1.0 | Initial wireframes for comment delete flow |

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[avatar]` | User avatar (initials) |
| `_______` | Text / editable area | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / destructive action | `#` | Heading |
| `👤` | User / author | `→` | Focus moves to |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `main` for page content |
| Heading order | h1 for issue title, h2 for "Description", h3 for "Comments (N)" |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape (dismiss confirm) |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout within shared app-shell. Comment section occupies the full content area under issue metadata.

**Content hierarchy** (within comment section):
1. Comments heading
2. Comment cards (each with avatar, author name, timestamp, body, actions)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  App-shell: Header / Nav / Max-width container                   |
|                                                                  |
|  +-- Issue Detail Page (main) --------------------------------+  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  # Issue Title                               [Edit] [Delete] |  |
|  |  Identifier · Status · Priority · Assignee · Created/Updated |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  ## Description                                              |  |
|  |  Issue body text here...                                     |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  ## Labels                                                   |  |
|  |  [label-1] [label-2] [+ Add label]                           |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  -------- divider --------                                   |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  ### Comments (N)                                            |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  |  +-- CommentCard (author) --------------------------------+  |  |
|  |  | [avatar] Author Name · 2h ago                [✏] [🗑]   |  |  |
|  |  | Comment body text here...                                |  |  |
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |                                                              |  |  |
|  |  +-- CommentCard (non-author) ----------------------------+  |  |
|  |  | [avatar] Other User · 5h ago                           |  |  |
|  |  | Their comment text...                                   |  |  |
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |                                                              |  |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [Button] [Avatar] [#Heading] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Delete button [🗑] | Delete button (CommentCard) | Click opens inline confirmation; visible only for comment author; `aria-label="Delete comment"` | Truncation: N/A — fixed icon size |
| Cancel button | `Button variant="secondary" size="sm"` | Dismisses confirmation, returns focus to delete button | — |
| Confirm Delete button | `Button variant="danger" size="sm"` | Calls deleteComment API; shows spinner while loading | Network error: comment stays, error message shown |
| Inline confirmation area | Inline prompt pattern | Replaces action buttons row; shows question + Cancel/Delete buttons | — |
| Error alert | `<p role="alert">` | Appears below confirmation on failure | — |
| Toast (success) | `Toast variant="success"` | "Comment deleted" toast after successful deletion | Auto-dismiss after 3s |
| Toast (error) | `Toast variant="error"` | "Failed to delete comment" on API failure | Auto-dismiss after 5s |

## Data Display

Comment cards in vertical list (not table). Single-column layout. No sorting/pagination needed — all comments shown. Progressive disclosure: actions (edit/delete) visible only for author; confirmation replaces actions on demand.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Comments heading | "Comments ({count})" — section label with count | h3 element |
| Delete button | `aria-label="Delete comment"` — screen reader only | Icon button, no visible label |
| Confirmation text | "Are you sure you want to delete this comment?" — warning + ask confirmation | Plain language, not technical |
| Delete button (confirm) | "Delete" — confirm destructive action | Button label |
| Cancel button | "Cancel" — dismiss, no action | Button label |
| Success toast | "Comment deleted" — confirmation of completion | Success variant |
| Error message | "Failed to delete comment. Please try again." — plain-language error + recovery | Error variant |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Default comment card with visible edit + delete buttons for author.

```
+-- CommentCard -----------------------------+
| [avatar] Author Name · 2h ago    [✏] [🗑] |
| Comment body text here...                  |
+--------------------------------------------+
```

### Confirm-Delete (Inline Confirmation Open)

Author clicked delete button; action buttons replaced by confirmation prompt.

```
+-- CommentCard -----------------------------+
| [avatar] Author Name · 2h ago              |
| Comment body text here...                  |
|                                             |
| Are you sure you want to delete             |
| this comment?                               |
|                           [Cancel] [Delete] |
+--------------------------------------------+
```

### Deleting (Submitting)

User clicked "Delete"; Delete button shows spinner, both buttons disabled.

```
+-- CommentCard -----------------------------+
| [avatar] Author Name · 2h ago              |
| Comment body text here...                  |
|                                             |
| Are you sure you want to delete             |
| this comment?                               |
|                     [Cancel] [Delete ⏳]    |
+--------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

API call failed; error message shown inline, user can retry.

```
+-- CommentCard -----------------------------+
| [avatar] Author Name · 2h ago              |
| Comment body text here...                  |
|                                             |
| ⚠ Failed to delete comment.                |
|   Please try again.                         |
|                                             |
| Are you sure you want to delete             |
| this comment?                               |
|                           [Cancel] [Delete] |
+--------------------------------------------+
```

### Success (Deleted)

Comment removed from list; toast at bottom-right indicates success.

```
+-- comments list ---------------------------+
| ### Comments (N-1)                         |
|                                             |
| [remaining comment cards...]                |
+--------------------------------------------+

        +-- Toast (bottom-right) ----------+
        | ✓  Comment deleted               |
        +-----------------------------------+
```

### Loading (Comments Loading)

Skeleton placeholder mirroring the populated layout while comments fetch.

```
+-- Issue Detail (main) ------------------------+
|                                                 |
|  ### Comments                                  |
|                                                 |
|  +-- SkeletonCard --------------------------+  |
|  |  [~~~~] ~~~~~~~~~~~~~ · ~~~~~~           |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
|  +------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                 |
|  +-- SkeletonCard --------------------------+  |
|  |  [~~~~] ~~~~~~~~~~~~~ · ~~~~~~           |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
|  +------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                 |
|  +-- SkeletonCard --------------------------+  |
|  |  [~~~~] ~~~~~~~~~~~~~ · ~~~~~~           |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
|  |  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~      |  |
