*`[~~~~]` = shimmer placeholder; 3 skeleton cards match typical comment count.*

### Empty (No Comments)

No comments yet; EmptyState component with guide-to-action.

```
+-- Issue Detail (main) ------------------------+
|                                                 |
|  ### Comments (0)                              |
|                                                 |
|  +-- EmptyState ----------------------------+  |
|  |                                            |  |
|  |        [💬]                               |  |
|  |     "No comments yet"                     |  |
|  |  "Be the first to share your              |  |
|  |           thoughts."                      |  |
|  |                                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------+  |
+--------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout: comment cards with horizontal action buttons |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout; touch targets remain ≥24×24px |
| Mobile (<768px) | Comment cards stack at full width; action buttons size adjusted to mobile touch targets; inline confirmation adapts to narrower width |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` contains issue detail + comments section |
| Heading order | h1 (issue title) → h2 (Description) → h3 (Comments (N)) |
| Reading / Focus order | Back → Issue header → Description → Labels → Actions → Comments heading → Comment cards top→bottom |
| Accessible names | Delete icon button gets `aria-label="Delete comment"` |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through comment actions; Enter/Space to activate delete; Escape to dismiss confirmation |
| Target size | Delete button ≥24×24px; visible label not required for icon-only with aria-label |
| Focus management | Confirm open → focus to "Delete" button; Cancel / Escape → focus back to delete button; Delete success → focus to next comment card or Comments heading |
| Non-color intent | Delete icon (🗑) + aria-label conveys action; danger color is supplemental |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
